.TH "AUTOSNAP" "1" "Jun 2026" "autosnap" "autosnap manual"

.SH NAME
autosnap-docs - Show installed documentation locations


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBautosnap docs [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Show where autosnap documentation is installed.

.PP
Packaged installs include manual pages and Markdown documentation. Source builds may
not have those files installed on the local system.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for docs


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBautosnap(1)\fP
